  function renderTreasury(){const s=snap(),q=String($('seaVibeTreasurySearch')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase(),from=$('seaVibeTreasuryFrom')?.value||'',to=$('seaVibeTreasuryTo')?.value||'';const all=s.treasuryMovements||[],rows=all.filter(x=>{const d=String(x.date||'').slice(0,10);return(!q||`${x.serial} ${x.reference} ${x.description}`.toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!from||d>=from)&&(!to||d<=to)});const income=all.filter(x=>x.amount>0).reduce((a,x)=>a+x.amount,0),outgoing=Math.abs(all.filter(x=>x.amount<0).reduce((a,x)=>a+x.amount,0)),assetOutgoing=Math.abs(all.filter(x=>x.type==='asset_expense').reduce((a,x)=>a+x.amount,0));$('seaVibeTreasuryBalance').textContent=money(income-outgoing);$('seaVibeTreasuryIncome').textContent=money(income);$('seaVibeTreasuryOutgoing').textContent=money(outgoing);$('seaVibeTreasuryAssetOutgoing').textContent=money(assetOutgoing);$('seaVibeTreasuryBody').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><strong>${esc(x.serial||'—')}</strong></td><td>${esc(dateText(x.date||String(x.at||'').slice(0,10)))}</td><td>${esc(x.type==='trip_revenue'?t('seaVibe.treasury.tripRevenue','إيراد رحلة'):x.type==='asset_expense'?t('seaVibe.treasury.assetExpense','مصروف أصل'):x.type==='zawel_topup'?t('seaVibe.treasury.zawelTopup','شحن زاول'):x.type==='fuel_topup'?t('seaVibe.treasury.fuelTopup','شحن بنزين'):t('seaVibe.treasury.expense','مصروف'))}</td><td>${esc(x.reference||'—')}</td><td>${esc(x.description||'—')}</td><td class="sea-vibe-money ${x.amount>=0?'sea-vibe-profit-positive':'sea-vibe-profit-negative'}">${esc(money(x.amount))}</td><td>${treasuryActions(x)}</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty-cell">${esc(t('seaVibe.treasury.empty','لا توجد حركات خزنة.'))}</td></tr>`;applyPermissions();}
  function zawelCost(points){return Number((Number(points||0)*575/2500).toFixed(2));}
  function renderZawel(){const s=snap(),b=s.zawelBalance||{};$('seaVibeZawelBalance').textContent=`${new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US').format(b.balancePoints||0)} ${t('seaVibe.zawel.point','نقطة')}`;$('seaVibeZawelBalanceSar').textContent=`≈ ${money(zawelCost(b.balancePoints||0))}`;$('seaVibeZawelCharged').textContent=`${new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US').format(b.totalChargedPoints||0)} ${t('seaVibe.zawel.point','نقطة')}`;$('seaVibeZawelDeducted').textContent=`${new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US').format(b.totalDeductedPoints||0)} ${t('seaVibe.zawel.point','نقطة')}`;$('seaVibeZawelBody').innerHTML=(s.zawelTransactions||[]).length?s.zawelTransactions.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(dateText(x.transactionDate||String(x.createdAt||'').slice(0,10)))}</td><td>${esc(x.type==='topup'?t('seaVibe.zawel.topupMovement','شحن'):x.type==='permit'?t('seaVibe.zawel.permitMovement','خصم تصريح إبحار'):t('seaVibe.zawel.adjustmentMovement','تسوية تصريح'))}</td><td class="sea-vibe-money ${x.pointsDelta>=0?'sea-vibe-profit-positive':'sea-vibe-profit-negative'}">${x.pointsDelta>0?'+':''}${new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US').format(x.pointsDelta)}</td><td>${esc(money(x.cashAmount))}</td><td>${esc(x.reference||'—')}</td><td>${esc(x.notes||'—')}</td><td>${x.type==='topup'?`<button type="button" class="secondary-btn" data-sv-edit-zawel-topup="${esc(x.id)}" data-permission-screen="seaVibeZawel" data-permission-action="edit">${esc(t('seaVibe.common.edit','تعديل'))}</button> <button type="button" class="secondary-btn" data-sv-delete-zawel-topup="${esc(x.id)}" data-permission-screen="seaVibeZawel" data-permission-action="delete">${esc(t('seaVibe.common.delete','حذف'))}</button>`:esc(t('seaVibe.zawel.systemManaged','تلقائي'))}</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty-cell">${esc(t('seaVibe.zawel.empty','لا توجد حركات زاول.'))}</td></tr>`;applyPermissions();}

  function openZawelTopupEdit(id){const row=snap().zawelTransactions.find(x=>String(x.id)===String(id)&&x.type==='topup');if(!row)return;editingZawelTopupId=row.id;$('seaVibeZawelTopupDate').value=row.transactionDate||localDateIso();$('seaVibeZawelTopupPoints').value=Math.max(0,Number(row.pointsDelta||0));$('seaVibeZawelTopupCost').value=money(zawelCost(row.pointsDelta));$('seaVibeZawelTopupNotes').value=row.notes||'';$('seaVibeZawelTopupForm').classList.remove('hidden');$('seaVibeZawelTopupPoints').focus();}


  function addDateDays(value,days){if(!value)return'';const [y,m,d]=String(value).split('-').map(Number),dt=new Date(Date.UTC(y,m-1,d+Number(days||0)));return`${dt.getUTCFullYear()}-${String(dt.getUTCMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(dt.getUTCDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`;}
  function setFuelMode(mode='balance'){
    fuelViewMode=mode==='settlement'?'settlement':'balance';
    const isSettlement=fuelViewMode==='settlement';
    $('seaVibeFuelBalancePanel')?.classList.toggle('hidden',isSettlement);
    $('seaVibeFuelSettlementPanel')?.classList.toggle('hidden',!isSettlement);
    $('seaVibeFuelTopupBtn')?.classList.toggle('hidden',isSettlement);
    $('seaVibeFuelBalanceTab')?.classList.toggle('is-active',!isSettlement);
    $('seaVibeFuelSettlementTab')?.classList.toggle('is-active',isSettlement);
    $('seaVibeFuelBalanceTab')?.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(!isSettlement));
    $('seaVibeFuelSettlementTab')?.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(isSettlement));
    if(isSettlement){
      const rows=snap().fuelSettlements||[],last=rows[0]?.cutoffDate||'';
      const input=$('seaVibeFuelSettlementDate');
      if(input){
        input.max=localDateIso();
        input.min=last?addDateDays(last,1):'';
        const noOpenCutoff=Boolean(input.min&&input.max&&input.min>input.max);
        input.disabled=noOpenCutoff;
        if(noOpenCutoff){
          input.value='';
          showStatus('seaVibeFuelSettlementStatus',t('seaVibe.fuel.noOpenCutoffToday','لا يوجد تاريخ تسوية جديد متاح اليوم بعد آخر Cutoff معتمد.'),'info');
        }else if(!input.value||(input.min&&input.value<input.min)||input.value>input.max){
          input.value=input.max;
        }
      }
      renderFuelSettlementHistory();
    }
  }
  function settlementGateText(gate){const map={READY:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementReady','التسوية جاهزة للاعتماد.'),HOLD_FUTURE_CUTOFF:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementFuture','لا يمكن اختيار تاريخ تسوية مستقبلي.'),HOLD_CUTOFF_NOT_AFTER_LAST:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementCutoffLocked','يجب أن يكون تاريخ التسوية بعد آخر Cutoff معتمد.'),HOLD_INVALID_WEIGHTS:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementWeightsInvalid','نسب التوزيع غير صحيحة؛ يجب أن يكون مجموعها 100%.'),HOLD_PENDING_VALUATION:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementPendingValuation','لا يمكن التسوية قبل اكتمال تقييم اللترات بسعر لتر صالح.'),HOLD_NO_ELIGIBLE_TRIPS:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementNoTrips','لا توجد رحلات مؤهلة داخل فترة التسوية.'),HOLD_TRIP_FUEL_INCOMPLETE:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementFuelIncomplete','توجد رحلات بلا تكلفة بنزين نظامية مكتملة.'),HOLD_ALREADY_ZERO:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementAlreadyZero','الرصيد عند هذا التاريخ يساوي صفر بالفعل.'),HOLD_NEGATIVE_TRIP_FUEL_COST:t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementNegativeTripCost','التوزيع المقترح سيجعل تكلفة بنزين رحلة سالبة؛ لا يمكن الاعتماد.')};return map[gate]||gate||t('seaVibe.fuel.settlementNotReady','التسوية غير جاهزة للاعتماد.');}
  function renderFuelSettlementHistory(){const rows=snap().fuelSettlements||[],body=$('seaVibeFuelSettlementHistoryBody');if(!body)return;body.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(dateText(x.cutoffDate))}</td><td>${esc(x.previousCutoffDate?dateText(x.previousCutoffDate):'—')}</td><td class="sea-vibe-money">${esc(money(x.balanceBeforeValue))}</td><td class="sea-vibe-money">${esc(litersText(x.balanceBeforeLiters))}</td><td>${x.eligibleTripCount}</td><td>${new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:2}).format(x.peopleWeightPct)}% / ${new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:2}).format(x.hoursWeightPct)}%</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="6" class="empty-cell">${esc(t('seaVibe.fuel.noSettlements','لا توجد تسويات بنزين معتمدة.'))}</td></tr>`;}
